        "Content": "THE ASH - Show House Now For Sale - Call Now To Arrange A Viewing \r\n\r\n3 Bed End-of-Terrace | 118 sq.m / 1,264 sq.ft | Ard Valley\r\n\r\nThe Ash is a beautifully appointed three-bedroom end-of-terrace show home, thoughtfully designed to combine contemporary style, generous living space and everyday practicality. Fully furnished by Elk Interiors, the property is finished to a high standard throughout, creating a sophisticated and welcoming home ready to move into.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the house is the impressive kitchen and dining area, featuring a vaulted ceiling that floods the space with natural light and creates a wonderful sense of volume and openness. The additional height adds architectural character while making the kitchen feel exceptionally spacious and airy — an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nAs an end-of-terrace home, The Ash benefits from the added privacy and convenience of a side entrance leading directly to the landscaped rear garden. The garden provides a beautifully finished outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining, while two dedicated parking spaces add further convenience.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the spacious master bedroom provides a peaceful retreat and features a stylish en-suite bathroom. The home also includes two further well-proportioned bedrooms and a main bathroom, with Hansgrohe taps and showers providing a premium finishing touch.\r\n\r\nPracticality is equally well considered. Underfloor heating to the ground floor provides comfortable, even warmth, while the property is pre-wired for EV charging, making it ready for future electric vehicle ownership. Attic stairs are included, providing easy access to valuable additional storage space.\r\n\r\nWith its generous proportions, exceptional interior styling, private landscaped garden, two parking spaces and carefully considered specification, The Ash offers a stylish and highly functional modern home in Ard Valley.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n* 3-bedroom end-of-terrace home\r\n* 118 sq.m / 1,264 sq.ft\r\n* Fully furnished by elk interiors\r\n* Impressive vaulted kitchen ceiling\r\n* Side entrance to landscaped rear garden\r\n* Two parking spaces\r\n* Spacious master bedroom with en-suite\r\n* Hansgrohe taps and showers\r\n* Underfloor heating to ground floor\r\n* Pre-wired for EV charging\r\n* Attic stairs providing additional storage\r\n* Contemporary, high-quality specification\r\n\r\nView Floorplans Here:https://www.ardvalley.ie/#houses"
      },
